{"4419310": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Cursed Carts", "steam_appid": 4419310, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In Cursed Carts, you compete in teams from 1v1 up to 3v3 inside a massive mansion filled with more strange events than you’d ever want, racing against time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But this isn’t just a race against the opposing team.<br>The mansion has creatures, traps, and random events of its own. Sometimes they make your life harder. Sometimes they ruin your rivals instead.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The team that collects the most loot before time runs out wins.<br>But the mansion doesn’t really want that to happen.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Run and Hide</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4419310/extras/63f121c90d238b1891bfbbc0fedb875a.poster.avif?t=1782492173\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4419310/extras/63f121c90d238b1891bfbbc0fedb875a.webm?t=1782492173\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4419310/extras/63f121c90d238b1891bfbbc0fedb875a.mp4?t=1782492173\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Most of the time, you’re defenseless against the creatures. The safest option is to run and hide. There are hiding spots scattered across the map.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can play it safe and wait.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Or take the risk and face the monsters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your choice. You deal with the consequences.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Watch Your Surroundings</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4419310/extras/fc00079fea2f55aaee6ca6343280f8c9.poster.avif?t=1782492173\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4419310/extras/fc00079fea2f55aaee6ca6343280f8c9.webm?t=1782492173\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4419310/extras/fc00079fea2f55aaee6ca6343280f8c9.mp4?t=1782492173\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In a mansion this big, danger can come from anywhere. Some traps are obvious.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Some are waiting for you.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Don’t Touch Everything</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4419310/extras/ea127264d446094569f8486c3fb3cda6.poster.avif?t=1782492173\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4419310/extras/ea127264d446094569f8486c3fb3cda6.webm?t=1782492173\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4419310/extras/ea127264d446094569f8486c3fb3cda6.mp4?t=1782492173\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Yes, that item looked perfectly safe. You touched it. Something happened. Your plan collapsed. Nothing in this mansion is innocent. If you’re not sure, don’t touch it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unless you enjoy chaos.</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In Cursed Carts, you compete in teams from 1v1 up to 3v3 inside a massive mansion filled with more strange events than you’d ever want, racing against time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But this isn’t just a race against the opposing team.<br>The mansion has creatures, traps, and random events of its own. Sometimes they make your life harder. Sometimes they ruin your rivals instead.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The team that collects the most loot before time runs out wins.<br>But the mansion doesn’t really want that to happen.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Run and Hide</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4419310/extras/63f121c90d238b1891bfbbc0fedb875a.poster.avif?t=1782492173\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4419310/extras/63f121c90d238b1891bfbbc0fedb875a.webm?t=1782492173\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4419310/extras/63f121c90d238b1891bfbbc0fedb875a.mp4?t=1782492173\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Most of the time, you’re defenseless against the creatures. The safest option is to run and hide. There are hiding spots scattered across the map.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can play it safe and wait.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Or take the risk and face the monsters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your choice. You deal with the consequences.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Watch Your Surroundings</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4419310/extras/fc00079fea2f55aaee6ca6343280f8c9.poster.avif?t=1782492173\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4419310/extras/fc00079fea2f55aaee6ca6343280f8c9.webm?t=1782492173\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4419310/extras/fc00079fea2f55aaee6ca6343280f8c9.mp4?t=1782492173\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In a mansion this big, danger can come from anywhere. Some traps are obvious.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Some are waiting for you.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Don’t Touch Everything</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4419310/extras/ea127264d446094569f8486c3fb3cda6.poster.avif?t=1782492173\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4419310/extras/ea127264d446094569f8486c3fb3cda6.webm?t=1782492173\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4419310/extras/ea127264d446094569f8486c3fb3cda6.mp4?t=1782492173\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Yes, that item looked perfectly safe. You touched it. Something happened. Your plan collapsed. Nothing in this mansion is innocent. If you’re not sure, don’t touch it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unless you enjoy chaos.</p>", "short_description": "A PvPvE horror game playable with 2–6 players. Compete against each other with your alien team split into two groups. In a massive mansion filled with creatures, the team that collects the most loot within the time limit wins.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong>, French, Italian, German, Spanish - Spain, Simplified Chinese, Portuguese - Brazil, Traditional Chinese, Japanese, Korean, Russian, Turkish<br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4419310/ba9f372bbb2715d2b71a400c549677d5f45857e9/header.jpg?t=1782492173", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4419310/0caf10077e9154a1b73c91627a88721997af43f3/capsule_2